      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "The latest dev branch should work.\n```console\n% uvx --refresh git+https://gitlab.com/Chips4Makers/c4m-arrakeen-memgen.git@dev\nThis is project Arrakeen's memory generator.\nThis is pre-alpha quality software; just above proof-of-concept level.\nDon't use it for production; no support is provided and use is at own risk!\nIf it breaks you may keep the pieces.\n\nSelect technologies:\n1) IHP SG13G2\n2) Sky130\n3) GF180MCU\n\n...```",
