    {
      "id": "1566430428070416536",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-01T12:35:16.922+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I'm gonna draw up a 2L flex board using the JLC special (5pcs up to 100x100 2L 1/3oz thin PI core only no stiffeners no soldering); I'm currently planning to do a multi-opportunity breakout board that utilizes the 3 flip chip bond pad structures in various combinations/styles (there's 3 nets; 2 of the 3 structures only have one pad per net; the third structure has larger grid pads and offers each net twice and routed so that it's at most diagonally/corner adjacent not sidways to challenge bonding processes that may be prone to shorting out adjacent pins), wiring out the DUT nets to some sort of \"connector\" that an ohmmeter can then be connected to for testing bond quality.\nWhat kind of connector would you think I should go with there?\nSome kinda 4-wire ZIF style replicated around the outer border to hopefully cover all the DUT bonds so that a tester could be ZIF-connected to all of them in series to try them?\nJust a wider ZIF connector for like each DUT/bond site approximately and plan on using an external breakout from that to a pin header or such?\nSolder connections for attaching pin headers to the flex around the edge after the flip chip bonding has been done?\n\nAny opinions? @Essen @Lauri @Andrew Wingate ?",
      "author": {
        "id": "262706220073222144",
        "name": "namibj",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "namibj",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-11_media/f885abc0dddd0a33e4d4991b3c99091d-7ACD2.png"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "756011607603019777",
          "name": "anfroholic",
          "discriminator": "0000",
          "nickname": "Andrew Wingate",
          "color": null,
          "isBot": false,
          "roles": [
            {
              "id": "1423020172595298314",
              "name": "Mod",
              "color": null,
              "position": 4
            }
          ],
          "avatarUrl": "2026-11_media/67bd670a335a2f955fb2ded57088a2cb-675B3.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "908721221682733106",
          "name": "lauri4332",
          "discriminator": "0000",
          "nickname": "Lauri",
          "color": null,
          "isBot": false,
          "roles": [],
          "avatarUrl": "2026-11_media/5-E9BDB.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "509798510170865675",
          "name": "essen__",
          "discriminator": "0000",
          "nickname": "Essen",
          "color": null,
          "isBot": false,
          "roles": [],
          "avatarUrl": "2026-11_media/80e086280c9caadd9c05998c3254c9a9-25B3D.png"
